# Job checkpoints (resumable runs; run-specific state, never commit).
# Keep these narrow. A bare *checkpoint* also matched man/clear_checkpoints.Rd,
# the help file of an exported function, which left the package shipping an
# undocumented object and failing R CMD check everywhere but the machine that
# had the file on disk.
checkpoints/
data/checkpoints/
*.checkpoint.rds

